## Reason

Reviews A, B, C at 05473af0 found that the chibi-quest default reached Reading
Advantage (secondary) projects. Spec puts them out of scope (spec.md:159).
The decided rule (orchestrator default, PM-confirmed) gives chibi-quest only
when project.json has no look and type is primary. A secondary project, a
project with no type, a non-object meta, and null meta give classic. Green r4
(f8de333e) implemented it. The Red file then failed 2 tests: its 6
NEW_EDITIONS entries and its rewritten fixture state no type. A real Primary
project.json always states type primary (createProject and the Settings
dialog write it). This round adds type primary to those 7 fixtures.

